{"title": "Fit to Burst", "pageid": 26703, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fit_to_Burst", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/300px-Generic_Explosion.webp, /w/images/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/300px-Generic_Explosion.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Fit to Burst</b> is a Passive Feature available only to <a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Glutton\" title=\"Intellect Glutton\">Intellect Gluttons</a>. It uses this ability to explode when it dies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When the intellect glutton dies, it bursts in a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Morphic_Brine_Explosion\" title=\"Morphic Brine Explosion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Morphic Brine Explosion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Morphic_Brine_Explosion\" title=\"Morphic Brine Explosion\">Morphic Brine Explosion</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Intellect_Glutton\" title=\"Intellect Glutton\">Intellect Glutton</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202822\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 668/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3299/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1669/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 154/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643644/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.873      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   27.873      1 -total\n 35.13%    9.792      1 Template:SAI\n 32.81%    9.145      1 Template:Icon_link\n 31.61%    8.810      1 Template:Icon_text\n 27.88%    7.770      2 Template:Trim\n 23.97%    6.681      1 Template:Ifempty\n 16.96%    4.728      1 Template:PageSeo\n 15.89%    4.428      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.91%    3.599      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:26703-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202822 and revision id 168328. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}